Block sanity (`defineBlockSanityTests`) is now all of sanity: it also runs the emptied-region, listing-in-container and page-integrity suites from the same discovery. Registered separately, they were run by Inka and DDS and by no other frontend. `defineEmptyRegionTests`, `defineListingContainerTests` and `definePageIntegrityTests` are no longer exported: drop a separate call to one. A frontend new to them may find listing-container gaps (a container that allows a listing with no example of one): add the example, or stop the container allowing it.
